          "quotes": [
            {
              "text": "Everything is excellent! I'm so thankful I found this spot while passing through NM. The veggie tacos are yum, their salsas add a really good kick, and the service is great. Really recommend!",
              "author": "Carolina",
              "stars": 5
            },
            {
              "text": "This a casual place with excellent food and service. The server was super nice and price was very good for the amount and quality of food you get! Would definitely recommend come back!",
