              "stars": 5
            },
            {
              "text": "Loved it! Quick, friendly and great food. A definite must try.",
              "author": "beau stites",
              "stars": 5
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Facebook",
          "rating": "100%",
          "countLabel": "from 39 reviews",
          "href": "https://www.facebook.com/elvagon/",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "text": "My family and I were passing through Las Cruces on our way to Mexico. Amazing food, friendly staff, fair prices! Would recommend 100%.",
              "author": "Viki López",
              "stars": 5
            },
            {
              "text": "Authentic mexican food. very tasty and delicious. A 5 star.",
              "author": "WilMil Yazz",
              "stars": 5
            },
            {
              "text": "Delicious tacos! If I lived in Las Cruces I would be there all the time!",
              "author": "Maureen Young Tortorella",
              "stars": 5
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Yelp",
          "rating": "4.7",
          "countLabel": "out of 64 reviews",
          "href": "https://www.yelp.com/biz/el-vagon-tacos-las-cruces",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "text": "Delicious vegan tacos for me, yummy tacos for my carnivorous son. A win win! We ate here twice on our 2-day trip to Las Cruces, so good! Friendly and competent service. Can't wait to visit Las Cruces again so we can come back!",
              "author": "Kerri W.",
              "stars": 5
            },
            {
              "text": "The Alambre tacos with a Mexican Coke is delicious. Great flavor. Quick and friendly service. The inside is fun and friendly and clean. Will definitely return.",
              "author": "Aric C.",
              "stars": 5
            },
            {
              "text": "The tacos were amazing! The portions are huge, and the left overs were just as good. Our server Arely was so nice, everyone was nice I would definitely recommend!",
              "author": "Lisa H.",
              "stars": 5
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Google",
          "rating": "4.8",
          "countLabel": "out of 582 reviews",
          "href": "https://www.google.com/maps/place/El+Vagon+Tacos/@32.2957917,-106.7626113,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x86de17e1323b3727:0xa729e630210c1dc!8m2!3d32.2957917!4d-106.7600364!16s%2Fg%2F11t8dv788t?hl=en-US&entry=ttu",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "text": "Everything you'd expect from a small cafe in the barrio! Great atmosphere, beautiful views around the building & of course, the very delicious TRUE New Mexico style food! Full of flavors and just the right amount of heat. Very recommend!",
              "author": "Raymond Barron",
              "stars": 5
            },
            {
              "text": "Bring your appetite and empty stomach. They're very generous with the meat! Amazing tacos, perfect portions, the best beans in Las Cruces.",
              "author": "Sara Beth Moran",
              "stars": 5
            },
            {
              "text": "Everything is excellent! I'm so thankful I found this spot while passing through NM. The veggie tacos are yum, their salsas add a really good kick, and the service is great. Really recommend!",
              "author": "Carolina",
              "stars": 5
            }
